# Cron alternative for running the VeriClick domain health scan every 15 minutes.
# `check_domains --once` runs a single pass and exits, so cron is a reliable
# scheduler (systemd timers or a PaaS cron are equally fine).
#
# 1) Edit your crontab:
#      crontab -e
# 2) Add a line like this, adjusting paths to your install:
#
#   */15 * * * *  cd /opt/vericlick/vericlick-backend/Vericlick_project && /opt/vericlick/.venv/bin/python manage.py check_domains --once >> /var/log/vericlick-domains.log 2>&1
#
# The trailing `--once` is important: without it the process would loop forever.
